# Every draft skip rendering (hosted_gates.draft: skip) the markdown family shipped, oldest first:
# "<sha256>  <path>", the digest over the LF text. The last line is the current skip rendering;
# every earlier line must be in the family's Prior, or a copy of it is orphaned when the skip
# shape changes. TestShippedTextLedger enforces both; PRAETOR_UPDATE_SHIPPED_TEXTS=1 appends.
